{%- if template contains 'article' and article.handle == 'press/gifting-for-the-cyclist-in-your-life-why-our-bags-work' -%}
<script type="application/ld+json">
[
  {
    "@context": "http://schema.org",
    "@type": "Article",
    "name": "Gifting for the Cyclist in Your Life – Why Our Bags Work",
    "headline": "Gifting for the Cyclist in Your Life – Why Our Bags Work",
    "description": "Finding the perfect gift for a cyclist can feel tricky. Discover why adaptable bike bags make the best gifts for cyclists - practical, versatile, and thoughtful accessories they'll use every single day on and off the bike.",
    "articleBody": "Finding the perfect gift for a cyclist can feel tricky. They're particular about their gear, already own the basics, and value function just as much as style. The good news? The right bike bag isn't just an accessory — it's something they'll use every single day.\nIf you're searching for gifts for cyclists, bike accessories gifts, or thoughtful urban cycling gifts, you're in the right place. At Garner and Tow, we design adaptable bike bags made for real life on and off the bike — and that's what makes them such an easy, meaningful gift.\n \n\n \nWhy Bike Bags Make the Best Gifts for Cyclists\nUnlike tech gadgets or bike parts, a well-designed bag doesn't require knowing exact specs or preferences. A great bike bag should:\n\n\nWork across different riding styles\n\n\nTransition seamlessly off the bike\n\n\nFeel elevated enough for daily life\n\n\nLast for years, not seasons\n\n\nOur bags are designed to do exactly that — attach securely to a bike, then convert into a comfortable, functional everyday bag. It's practical, versatile, and thoughtful, which makes it a gift that actually gets used.\n \n\n \nGifts for Every Type of Cyclist\n- The Daily Commuter\nThey bike to work, coffee, errands — rain or shine.\nWhat they need:\n\n\nA bag that fits work essentials\n\n\nComfortable to wear off the bike\n\n\nClean, understated design\n\n\nWhy our bags work: Padded laptop sleeves, intuitive organization, and a streamlined silhouette mean they don't have to swap bags when they lock up their bike. It's a polished solution for everyday commuting — perfect for urban cyclists who value both function and style.\n \n\n \n- The Urban Rider\nThey bike for convenience, movement, and freedom — not just speed.\nWhat they need:\n\n\nA versatile, lightweight bag\n\n\nEasy access pockets\n\n\nA design that fits into city life\n\n\nWhy our bags work: Our adaptable designs move effortlessly from bike to body, making them ideal urban cycling gifts. Whether they're hopping between meetings, grocery stops, or weekend plans, the bag goes with them — no compromises.\n \n\n \n\n- The Weekend Explorer\nThey ride for joy, errands, and casual adventures.\nWhat they need:\n\n\nEnough room for daily essentials\n\n\nComfort and durability\n\n\nA bag that doesn't feel overly technical\n\n\nWhy our bags work: Our bags are thoughtfully designed to carry what matters most — water bottle, book, lunch, layers — without feeling bulky. They're approachable, well-made, and ready for whatever the day brings.\n \n\n \nEasy Gift-Giving (Even If You Don't Ride)\nYou don't need to be a cyclist to give a great cycling gift.\nGarner and Tow bags are:\n\n\nUniversal — no sizing or bike compatibility stress\n\n\nUnisex and timeless — designed to age well\n\n\nPractical but special — something they'll use daily\n\n\nIf you're unsure which style to choose, bike bags are one of the safest bike accessories gifts because they solve a real problem without being overly specific.\n \n\n \nA Premium Gift That's Built to Last\nEvery Garner and Tow bag is made with intention — from durable materials to careful construction — because we believe fewer, better things make the best gifts.\nThis isn't a novelty item or trend-driven accessory. It's a long-term companion for daily rides, commutes, and city life. That's what makes it feel premium — and why it's a gift that won't be forgotten.\n \n\n \nGifting Season Is Here\nIf you're shopping for the cyclist in your life, now is the time. Limited production runs and high seasonal demand mean our most popular styles tend to sell quickly.\nThoughtful, functional, beautifully made — a Garner and Tow bag is a gift that meets them where they are, on and off the bike.\n👉 Explore our collection and find the perfect gift for the cyclist in your life.",
